The ledger has one obligation, line 1: the Kobayashi IV must not be shown fighting as a ship while still docked at Bleakhold Station. The narration has her "still docked at the ring" and then "turns her bow and fires again on the Ashen Wake," which is exactly the forbidden combination. The "fires" and "turns her bow" language is ship-level action, so this is a breach.

